5. STEP 4 – VALIDATE THE CMP PFX BEFORE CREATING JKS
===============================================================================

Always validate the PFX before converting it.

This confirms that the certificate received from CMP contains the expected
certificate and private key.


COMMAND:

keytool -list -v -storetype PKCS12 -keystore CertAndKey.pfx


The command prompts for the PFX password.

Validate the following information:

