14.2 ISSUE – APPROACH WAS NOT CITI STANDARD
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

After the initial implementation, we received communication stating that the
certificate creation approach was not the Citi-standard process.

The key learning was:

A JKS may technically work, but that does not mean the certificate/private-key
creation process follows enterprise certificate-management standards.

The application certificate should originate from the approved Citi certificate
management process.


